@page "/interactive-webassembly"
@rendermode InteractiveWebAssembly

<PageTitle>Interactive WebAssembly</PageTitle>

<h1>Interactive WebAssembly</h1>

<p>
    This page is rendered interactively by Blazor WebAssembly. The client assembly, including the
    shared showcase component, is downloaded to the browser. The library's <code>AddJeninFontAwesome</code>
    registration runs inside the WebAssembly host, and click events execute in the browser.
</p>

